    interface contract, else None. Reads active interface + markers from env (set
    by claude_runner): TESTBED_INTERFACE, TESTBED_SDK_MODULE, TESTBED_CLI_BINARY,
    TESTBED_COMPUTE_DENY, TESTBED_PLATFORM.
